 "titulo": "My friends were already safe in the village 😰 Part 2 #horror #shorts",
 "capa": "WHO SAT BY THE FIRE",
 "descripcion": "The footprints stopped at the door. Then one bar of signal, and a message from the rescue station.\n\n> Part 3: {when_next}.\nWho was sitting by the fire?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "The footprints stopped at the door. Nobody knocked.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Just the wind, and something breathing against the wall.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Pavel, the biggest of us, wanted to go look.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He said: it's an animal, Mira. Let me check.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I pointed at the door. Rule one: stay inside.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He sat back down, slowly, and looked at me for a long time.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Nobody slept. Every hour, I counted. Four. Always four.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "At 2:30, my phone found one bar of signal.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I stood on the bench and held the phone to the window.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "A message from the rescue station.",
   "pausa": 0.4
  },
  {
   "texto": "Mira, where are you? Your three friends are here with us.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "I read it twice. My hands were shaking.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "They came down to the village at sunset. Safe.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I looked at the three faces around the stove.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "So who was sitting by my fire?",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "The one I called Pavel smiled, and said: count again.",
   "pausa": 0.9
  },
  {
   "texto": "Part three, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
